# Repo-local override: this repo IS the archcontext product; .archcontext/ is
# Git-visible architecture truth (see CLAUDE.md), only .local/ is runtime state.
# Keep this block after the repo-harness managed block so a regenerated managed
# block that ignores .archcontext/ wholesale cannot silently swallow model nodes.
